{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Fighter Screen",
    "owner": "dcsturman@gmail.com",
    "description": "Two mirror forces in open space: each a Kinunir colonial cruiser standing in for a carrier, with fifteen heavy fighters formed up 2,000 km ahead of her, five abreast in three rows. The fighter screens start 55,000 km apart, at rest: at Distant, where each side has only the other's blips until they close. For training a network on fights larger than eight ships a side."
